<%--
Billing_Index_Page_Actions

The billing list's page-header button: New entry, a menu of the three kinds an entry can be.
Each item opens the add form with its kind fixed (?type=N). Billing_Index_Action hands it to
the layout from page_actions(); the project view's Billing tab carries the same menu with the
project chosen ($project_id).

$project_id - optional; the project the new entry is for
--%>
<Define:Billing_Index_Page_Actions class="dropdown d-inline-block">
    <%
        const _extra = this.args.project_id ? { project_id: this.args.project_id } : {};
        const _href = (type) => Rsx.Route('Billing_Edit_Action', { type: type, ..._extra });
    %>
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm dropdown-toggle" type="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle"></i> New entry
    </button>
    <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end">
        <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="<%= _href(Billable_Entry_Model.TYPE_TIME) %>"><i class="bi bi-stopwatch"></i> Time</a></li>
        <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="<%= _href(Billable_Entry_Model.TYPE_EXPENSE) %>"><i class="bi bi-receipt"></i> Expense</a></li>
        <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="<%= _href(Billable_Entry_Model.TYPE_FIXED_FEE) %>"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin"></i> Fixed fee</a></li>
    </ul>
</Define:Billing_Index_Page_Actions>
